      fix(swift): allow semgrep ellipsis in protocol bodies and inheritance lists
      
      Extend the semgrep-swift grammar so two pattern shapes parse without
      ERROR nodes:
      
      - LANG-499: `protocol $P { ... }` -- override `_protocol_member_declaration`
        to accept `$.semgrep_ellipsis`. The existing `_type_level_declaration`
        override only covered class/struct/enum bodies; protocol bodies use a
        separate rule chain.
      - LANG-503: `class $C: $P, ... {}` and `class $C: $...PROTOS {}` -- override
        `inheritance_specifier` to accept `$.semgrep_ellipsis` and
        `$.semgrep_ellipsis_metavar`. Since class, struct, extension, enum, and
        protocol declarations all share `_inheritance_specifiers`, this single
        override covers all five.
      
      Adds corresponding corpus tests.
      
